<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	106.15/25 (+0.01)	   3.96 (unchd)</p>
<p>  Feb  2002		   113.92/02 (unchd)	   4.74 (+0.01)</p>
